# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# DocuMind AI — Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.

# ── Frontend ──────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=DocuMind AI
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Backend ───────────────────────────
# FastAPI
BACKEND_HOST=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_PORT=8000
ENVIRONMENT=development
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here-must-be-at-least-32-characters
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30

# ── Database ──────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL (Neon)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/documind_ai
POSTGRES_USER=documind
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your-password-here
POSTGRES_DB=documind_ai

# ── AI / LLM ─────────────────────────
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3:8b

# ── Vector Store ──────────────────────
# pgvector connection (uses same DATABASE_URL)
EMBEDDING_MODEL=BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS=384
CHUNK_SIZE=1000
CHUNK_OVERLAP=200

# ── Storage ───────────────────────────
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=50

# ── Auth ──────────────────────────────
# OAuth (future)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret

# ── Deployment ────────────────────────
VERCEL_TOKEN=your-vercel-token
RENDER_API_KEY=your-render-api-key
